me>Fussenegger</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Broad-spectrum protein biosensors for class-specific detection of antibiotics</article-title><source>Biotechnol. Bioeng.</source><year>2005</year><volume>89</volume><fpage>9</fpage><lpage>17</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15580576</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boorsma</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Nieba</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Koller</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Bachmann</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Bailey</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Renner</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A temperature-regulated replicon-based DNA expression system</article-title><source>Nat. Biotechnol.</source><year>2000</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>429</fpage><lpage>432</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10748525</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fussenegger</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Schlatter</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Datwyler</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Mazur</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Bailey</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Controlled proliferation by multigene metabolic engineering enhances the productivity of Chinese hamster ovary cells</article-title><source>Nat. Biotechnol.</source><year>1998</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>468</fpage><lpage>472</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9592397</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publi